{"id":"wb-4-95","name":"阁院寺","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"阁院寺","text":"阁院寺，是位于中国河北省保定市涞源县城内的一座佛教寺庙，为全国重点文物保护单位。现存天王殿、文殊殿、藏经楼等建筑，主体建筑文殊殿为辽代木构建筑，是“八大辽构”之一。寺内保存有铸于辽天庆四年（1114年）的飞狐大钟。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E9%98%81%E9%99%A2%E5%AF%BA","revisionId":94811350,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=94811350","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/d4340c77e4dcfe7267484848.jpg","title":"左侧文殊殿.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E5%B7%A6%E4%BE%A7%E6%96%87%E6%AE%8A%E6%AE%BF.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/7f/%E5%B7%A6%E4%BE%A7%E6%96%87%E6%AE%8A%E6%AE%BF.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"狼狼君","license":"CC0","licenseUrl":"http://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/deed.en","caption":"​左侧文殊殿","width":320,"height":213}}